0x22e68b0962783ada2f29abb6f7c15edcbc464d3fd103c322b8d2d2eaa803565a,2026-04-23 06:32:56.821,Will Google (GOOGL) close above $220 end of April?,3,1777593600,t,"This market will resolve to ""Yes"" if the official closing price for Alphabet Inc. (GOOGL) on the final trading day of April 2026 is higher than the listed price. Otherwise, this market will resolve to ""No"".
