The resolution source for this market will be Spotify.",{https://polymarket.com/event/top-spotify-artist-in-april#will-justin-bieber-have-the-greatest-number-of-monthly-spotify-listeners-this-month},Will Justin Bieber have the greatest number of monthly Spotify listeners this month?,13374202,f,f,,,,0,27486,0,0x7e81ca51de1eecc5ed4f7ecbaa3156400c6b3b9c,0,f,"{Music,Culture,Spotify,""Rewards 50, 4.5, 20""}",0.205,9973.470774999998,https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/top-spotify-artist-2024-zhLoKxCkS05j.png,1462.399089,1987.958317,3401.545765000001,9973.470774999998,1462.399089,1987.958317,3401.545765000001,9973.470774999998,Justin Bieber
