0xd39a8e6673f0df07c6fc22d9dbeaf6a8b156b75d4f76ca1725156a38abc655ac,2026-04-14 14:32:53.092,"Will Elon Musk post 380-399 tweets from April 17 to April 24, 2026?",7,1777089540,t,"This market will resolve according to the number of times Elon Musk (@elonmusk), posts on X from April 17 12:00 PM ET to April 24, 2026 12:00 PM ET.
