0x8d99ed2f62324e114688b1ccb9b114b43305855a0b7e31df49237ee71de20c43,2026-04-10 04:01:57.574,Will Natural Gas (NG) hit (HIGH) $3.80 in April?,4,1777622399,t,"This market will resolve to ""Yes"" if, at any point during April 2026, any 1-minute candle for the Active Month of Natural Gas futures has a final ""High"" price equal to or above the listed price. Otherwise, this market will resolve to ""No"".
