0xf651028e673b09944a25df2462347f627a0128c85146cfb2c1be709338435f46,2026-04-09 00:05:31.321,"Will Iran strike Turkey by April 30, 2026?",4,1777607940,t,"This market will resolve to ""Yes"" if Iran initiates a drone, missile, or air strike on the listed country's soil or any official embassy or consulate of the listed country between market creation and April 30, 2026, 11:59 PM (ET). Otherwise, this market will resolve to ""No"".
