0x9b67e21af16ed4b5fea6ce9b4a8afd9fed55f35e71d9ee01935c88d9d394bdea,2026-04-09 00:05:25.37,Will WTI Crude Oil (WTI) hit (LOW) $40 in April?,4,1777521600,t,"This market will resolve to ""Yes"" if, at any point during April 2026, any 1-minute candle for the Active Month of WTI Crude Oil futures has a final ""Low"" price equal to or below the listed price. Otherwise, this market will resolve to ""No"".
