0x3bc499961c7f6275d809b53cd9c0ec366c8e871b7d665365754344fc114ed0b2,2026-04-09 00:04:43.423,"Will Iran strike Yemen by April 30, 2026?",4,1777607940,t,"This market will resolve to ""Yes"" if Iran initiates a drone, missile, or air strike on the listed country's soil or any official embassy or consulate of the listed country between market creation and April 30, 2026, 11:59 PM (ET). Otherwise, this market will resolve to ""No"".
