This market will resolve based on a consensus of credible reporting. In case of ambiguity, this market will resolve based on official information from the Government of Slovenia.",{https://polymarket.com/event/which-parties-will-be-part-of-the-next-government-of-slovenia#will-the-slovenian-democratic-party-sds-be-part-of-the-next-government-of-slovenia-311},Will the Slovenian Democratic Party (SDS) be part of the next Government of Slovenia?,13374202,f,f,,,,0,7195,0,0xa5ec46b834ac33ec68e30e7ddeedbbbd4f461784,0,f,{},0.935,24907.22152499999,https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-slovenian-democratic-party-sds-win-the-most-seats-in-the-2026-slovenian-parliamentary-election-344-juorimgRWZhU.png,0,64.32000000000001,363.012966,1953.334603,0,64.32000000000001,363.012966,1953.334603,
